{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1447,
  "batch_count": 1645,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "d2656fb43e00556ee3186c852692cfa26a722dbc",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e87eacca61f775b44d30bde8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "思う存分、ご覧になったら。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7a1964335f79f0801292def907dcae1691e2ee46475694d9f77e9fa1ff76fc69",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1086",
        "70019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7e70369bfb3df807825095b1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "愛らしいデザインよね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8bdf4348d8019c3837cd682f065f442b3ba4c1d27429c0e0dcfb9aded41a7c7a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1086",
        "71004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:345ec998634418542b2b0981",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "華やかね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "30402706e7544a1a0e839a9f048fbdcd36c2dc5eb13b4aa376a07bfeb4ede031",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1086",
        "71008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f037896680c96587adca04a3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "完璧なアシンメトリー…美しい。",
      "source_fingerprint": "45913271819b47b76c7aa2096d4095b7a5b2cfeb11e03caa2f3dde0a45087729",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1086",
        "71009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a6c72a4997a6e8a36904951a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "規則だもの、従うわ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6454bed639c68401c429169df0829625df0203d17c8d99e5aeb7715afc9cb1e9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1086",
        "71010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:66361da64dfa8055026a1894",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "体のラインがよく見えるところ、\r\n好きよ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dc43ec178ac38759fd824df2f5ea2fb7e1f217464eba7f2b67273037d300e7ac",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1086",
        "71014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9fb54104583c3ee264886805",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "レースに捧げる、愛のデザインよ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0062be63c1a6427800dc67c490c0170e0f999b9bd5b42843a3219fed352ab19c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1086",
        "71015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe3176c81f967f83548ef5e1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "これがお好きなの？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e32cd518853fe6fccd1d5d01899a0f801f0a2301357ad5f22f3ba8f8f17ebe3c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1086",
        "71018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ad841de007ad261b48a31bc5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "思う存分、ご覧になったら。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7a1964335f79f0801292def907dcae1691e2ee46475694d9f77e9fa1ff76fc69",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1086",
        "71019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8158a7d6c18b126c323e3c74",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ご苦労さま。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d071b78bdb5476f99b01aa6b859acf7ea39c09864ed3e484421c36050fc2dad2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1086",
        "80000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cc21bc888637d76380ca5321",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "おはよう。\r\nどうぞ、仕事を始めて頂戴。",
      "source_fingerprint": "df2e676c5973a0147cd44edbe0f5e35248da6d2d0c8b353ed5bf4d4886240033",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1086",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e5eb22152eca16d3dc9eb8ed",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "体は生き物…徹底的に管理しても、\r\n日々変化はある。だから、\r\n朝のボディチェックが肝要なの。",
      "source_fingerprint": "44cd729caca34c8dd492aea0056b78ec03adc326d6a7ce7acfe3b8ef2c68d630",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1086",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:160a011049ec2c46290945b5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "愛する行為は、生気を注ぐこと…\r\n体が飢えてしまわないように、\r\n食事で満たしておかなければ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4eaaf24e2e7b5be369687144c6679aeff86b5bb157178a8fbde48e050365341b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1086",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5e3e461eb3d0905d91ceade1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "テスト勉強…なんのために？\r\n点を取るだけなら、授業で十分。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e220b33fa1c2f81e9a45a2becc3679ca3de165401586c19c8bfe1c6e0ad162e8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1086",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f007f79225b279932f29937",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今日すべきことは全てなさって？\r\nでなければ、夢見が悪いわ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1dcb85ab9c05abca28ebd53a2e1ef7a5060ffab3e4a83e9d9cc6bafe7fe1a558",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1086",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:23b725de66d85d83ccf8e371",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "馨しいボディオイルで、体を労る\r\n…ゆっくり、肌に馴染むまで。\r\n明日の走りがより…美しくなるまで",
      "source_fingerprint": "d0e7f15b6d2d7f2ebbdb5d8e5a8f4b013cdcaa98d07c72ce919491fbcdea7192",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1086",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:651a86214d021aad3614efce",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "色彩に溢れた春…。\r\n自然のパレットから、\r\n色をとるのもいいものね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1802bf3c23bdd05e93e7c09b86bd1e03613c02f40cbb902b697fed6383bd3a71",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1086",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:62d2af79970f3d5cfa242fde",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "レモン水を頂ける。\r\n肌の塞がるような蒸し暑さ…\r\n不快だわ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1f1119170fbf36e3801bc2d43c2868620845d1b19b1d1b5e5e4082374db5b4b5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1086",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8740cb7b903c6b0e45f8edbb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "秋の楽しみね…。\r\n朝にブドウを頂くこと。\r\n気持ちのよい朝に走ること。",
      "source_fingerprint": "02a7ec30f9914918b21375d38ea87b9c3623aa1d0255b3ee7da984a93037b7d1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1086",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:57ffb568e2bcb0f3b64739d0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "雪が積もれば、無音の世界。\r\n…好きよ、ただ静かに…\r\nこの想いと向き合えるもの。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3084fe8c114bc9af685e8d8f9dbc4175433fc910ae38d6cbcae29aefe032466f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1086",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5f84e42c9ebff685582cfacb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ハッピーバレンタイン。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4865c793af7c6f55d7b7d4bd7d2831357df7998f6cd677be1b57d1f435964e08",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1086",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a002db496543089ce31a5dc7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "家には感謝しておりますの。\r\nこの愛を貫けるのだから…\r\n礼は尽くすわ、もちろん。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6520d3b23c8df954cc2cbb34fba28eb1f7845cd93735ad3ef55c07386c93148d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1086",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ea3ef8b3c272dde4c5ce9065",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "可愛いでしょう、アルダン。\r\n放っても、黙って私についてきて…\r\nああ…今はもう、違うわね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "54c81e0ca50f23442795b51fc887c170a4eb7fd10d99012939e45fd3211e2019",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1086",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9cba67c4394cbf1527dad02c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ルドルフとのランチは退屈…\r\nけれどディナーはよろしくてよ。\r\n眼差しが語るもの…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "603441555b7993cc48cf748d1dc01f076596aa33af397f5cb2d4bed0d0492324",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1086",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:992f547e2ab6b251b7ce89bd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "長い間、寵愛を受けた物…\r\nヴィンテージのその魅力が、\r\n手に取らせるのかしら。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7eebd0fd4a14185bae088394479625e4cbb0ef2f0c9a1411ec1ccb30449e9e46",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1086",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d76a8c026d05c01250681341",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "レースを想うと…\r\nただ焦がれる。\r\nターフが待ち遠しい…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6575793d97bf013097c4c2a91251e6ccfe2d88e094247ed025da3748d14bea2b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1086",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9adbb9afe8bdca4ea200be48",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "美しいドレープ…\r\nいいデザインね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e208fe543f8064f2433ad10cd5814eb585711b618f48bf747d6db88133dd656",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1086",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:53a264e90f19154d9a5546ae",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "メジロ家で、揃いの写真を\r\n撮るそうよ。\r\n皆ではしゃいでいるわ…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f0c16c12411a10bcfc7036eb5590b1b2c85fecb7d164311f594e43a17c659a99",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1086",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e3faf9c23968c03aea5f007f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "レースのために磨き上げた体を、\r\n最大限美しく見せてくれるもの。\r\nこのデザインが…答え。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bda58864756cdb209450135e94507cf685b4ac7ab1579d7133e628515c68a809",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1086",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e54d8fe43c3c00a0576b5ecd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "期待を集めて、レースへ挑む…\r\nそのために観客の視線も要るの。\r\n私から、目を逸らすことができて？",
      "source_fingerprint": "1338181f4d0035225af032c7e90285760159a3bcc1ed5b309debef26842777af",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1086",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f7a4ffa9270250b0e894d6f5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…なぁに。\r\n挨拶は済んだけれど。",
      "source_fingerprint": "28ebf923ffa0036dfb2c0cec9a25a031550ea9f2eb0139c1b272d89f05a64da5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1086",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8b4f874203547408897410d5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…………。\r\nまだ何か？",
      "source_fingerprint": "3889690248b2983ed8b161fc33daba5b3f2362235df84b0c574654d32219534f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1086",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cb19119cc763473738ed156a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "明日もまた、“貴方”に会える…\r\n私の愛――おやすみなさい。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e0e1449bdd3901875d519b51d99918d4d773ade96ebc7342764ef93286c4da40",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1086",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:92306d21ebced5bbe0eba925",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "貴方のデスク…花だらけよね。\r\n…ああ、そうだった。花束は全て、\r\nそちらへ運ばせていたわね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b8d065e83246cce8a96ac5a19e2b56b76fd8cc5711f9edff7c3b138b454c2aab",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1086",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:33b8a497c7434f9863f79a4e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "そろそろ、避暑地へ行こうかしら。\r\n森の中で走れば、\r\n熱を逃がせる…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cbff4f991dede4f4c7e3418aae28c0fed2e0e2408ad9cd0cb2d8f72a2d0db7a6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1086",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7fb5c327a3e6ff34e9794673",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "秋の夜は、思考の整理にぴったり。\r\n感覚と擦り合わせ、問い直す。\r\nそしてまた…愛に返るの。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b457704a70d57c13c0269d8fb7240e4e9fd3965f27150183d0db240e01fa6592",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1086",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:88c378b1fa29c20e3a5e48e8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "冷えは体を鈍らせる。\r\n内側から熱くならないと。\r\nそう、愛を燃え上がらせる…とか。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c338427be47b988c0067c9fc2754b284a65d340cca9898af77bd1403e076e093",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1086",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a03c6639507a647d06d98c1b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "トレーニングを\r\n始めましょう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b72334894334f5048c1817843baccccff299f4c9dee656e2be0e9dfb0b950d97",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1086",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5c91c5a0f45079d2e5e7a9ff",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "始めましょう",
      "source_fingerprint": "2fb2c0d2c897507cf8a696173aa7e6e146fd2980dffc024f7b7b0d68bbf1eecc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1086",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8d0bd65574d9ee506c3518b7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "完璧な計画があるのだから、\r\nそれに従うだけでいいわ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "359a142d18e6a7d8cf36c770f45f0b7a4d820a6cff03f490de0b293091b4dd8b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1086",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ba823ebd7ba20132b0ad6562",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "私には頂がとうに見えている。\r\n貴方はどうかしら…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "465758864bde307f7b0d197d681e150152a6b493358769f7d7054804b3855cb7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1086",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ca0de2abd4f6219a2d0c40ea",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下準備は入念に。\r\n愛を捧げる、\r\n大事な大事な脚だもの。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cdda7f7466950f62262e78052ab1291423994f14d006ba76c519eedc05206858",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1086",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9e94295974a27ed6df01f0b8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今日の貴方のプランは？\r\n受け入れるかは内容次第だけれど…\r\n従わせてくださるの？",
      "source_fingerprint": "98024bb3c5f2f04f656b05541769d632fceac5c93cdfe390046f4caa61af8fa5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1086",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ed0b2d01f2ae85bf6a636dff",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "確かな目で、見つめてくださる。\r\n今の私は…完璧かしら。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e830c6ad64b9df0ed4d4efd3d0c5e67a9320459323f960bce21eba88ad0635be",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1086",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6eb40d01d7b51cb0a1e5897a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "時間よ。\r\n貴方の手で…導いてご覧なさいな。",
      "source_fingerprint": "19ffc8d73482a6fa2bd966cf518a2de19ab141b69eb0473046b0cb59c870bdde",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1086",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4a4eeb255a2cc599c9f32e0d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ふぅ…わざわざ、\r\nより暑いほうを選ぶのね…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6165963ddef76d3b5befbb8988b05e31d9bec7c22f8ce300620b2eb48be03885",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1086",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1ca302d148f277a05ae906dd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "貴方の愛、頂いたわ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "febc3fad6cfa52e64f89aee75640bfec7cddbe07ae1e59ed2190e5d158f825c8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1086",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c18257e60f71c29bc66bb817",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "お疲れさま…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2f358c5c7746f8b8bca46e68bd8a34fb14e206d93de37d841f8a09abda6bba7b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1086",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:41a718455b01979a49023300",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "いい気分…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "491e321d1d823e7ce63b18844155873b1b93b447a6f6826cd2c76a4f4965781f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1086",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:446efa5470453e1a1a3b8463",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "完璧でなくてはね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "19a42735777b74b57dd6dea752786c9a3269979f4140c2f1a12f9970af314b58",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1086",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3ea6674fc5ca35b1b846d14a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "メジロラモーヌ、ですわ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3fbf941a38470f4c97822d81c2a0810f2fa8d2fe1ec10eff6f7ca40bf6056531",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1086",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fea3a815c477ffa2968f654d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "完璧に勝利して、完全を捧げる\r\n愛のために……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6e3556df9bfcd21b9ae7c35879dbba8881e41fde674706c1e1e95af69678fc46",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1086",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:54b1c3a8d09cccfd06012c40",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "需要我吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "98ee76acabfbf452d701ce940a378c46b76300a0d9e606b3d0927b0429c4c854",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1086",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0c6b0f4071cb77ea3e5c7680",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "既然要做，我就不会放水哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b483c7fc3c0becb812d1a7063856d3f8ada7e82fc70a5853d30984530d69f8f8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1086",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:725a90ab366e073ecb3d6dcc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那么，我们走吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "61a54c3e0a4c22fa18eec40b86616d9118dd4aacb049d8ce94a1df739a4dfd66",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9f98da4904318d9d590c95b3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论是什么样的小真，\r\n请你都要好好看着。\r\n……不可以忘记喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "501562c95368d5d1cc62e0daf2c9764024463267ede3264860c0a87e2f2f23cc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f302f04cf38b260f92cc93a2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我出发了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "874e7497e7be8367a4f334f4c7f1d69916bd93469660e8935829876ff0311191",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f644fd69b30a6602742c2323",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我回来了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f3f071de3a132d55ed31edf557b362afda8ef29b618fd0f52a13920ed7d26bb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:892b386f19688f64afa8c7f0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "每户人家都要有一个小真娃娃。\r\n训练员家里则要有两个以上，\r\n库存也拜托你一起管理啰。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a7c872aeb4ec47695b04800117b94210c2f4b1ec2b4baaf9fa1f6feb09ccd892",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ac2eb9e54a231f59a5ba5701",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要出问题了。昨天的小真\r\n跟今天的小真，有哪里不一样？\r\n答案就在你的心里喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "39e2b9642fd54aa906576731082bd2757fbb5756d4eb880f91c1f878c4164bfd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6b30434afdf242057cc13a38",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "镜饼～软绵绵的镜饼。\r\n小真的脸颊也一样软绵绵，\r\n请摸摸看吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "41f2096f9fc18248b8a83e3602abd64b26f0e896c7df2c51234027da42d4a0b5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9edb9c5d7bcf7bd2e5754156",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员有送友情巧克力给别人吗？\r\n或者你打算送真心巧克力……\r\n哎呀，我还是先不要问好了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e98af6958550afeaab50fa9ee1f476108f0693fdcc55130719620fc1fbf352a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ae6cd45fd654a86e0cf48830",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "话说我今天准备了\r\n限定一人份的糖渍栗子。\r\n……你会讨厌吃甜食吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "6c575887fc1fba5a94bca4dfb98cae71f2ea5dc1ba3fb6e634e7b649be4bb564",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:16b56e1929137333cf5f952b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一直有某个人想要与自己相见。\r\n织女和牛郎真是幸福呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f86926782f7ff3fbe004ff8749b0b0b65805af1b9abf996792ad258ea52409b2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:62ee4a406758a7ac6aff8f47",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "请告诉所有你认识的人，\r\n要变装的话推荐扮成小真喔，\r\n只要戴上王冠就行了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5c682bd8b18f7b48e6e74d50a1bb12fd35e1e3c659e850634714d01237e413d4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:840ca0dc4755155e8979dbde",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在大大的圣诞树下展露微笑的小真\r\n也非常可爱喔。\r\n所以说，要跟我一起出门吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "4efc0d2af087ed007ce49f8b7e3be2b87391921d20c3588af4b84b33dcf19b59",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4fd29ef6a51cd8578983f187",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我以前给圣诞老人添过一次麻烦，\r\n因为收到的礼物不是我想要的……\r\n当时的我是个任性的孩子。",
      "source_fingerprint": "02635e3f8b06dc2dbc1ecb19e59117af9fbbc196cc7cb25f310359aac3eca83d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d9d1d67d43b1f8bae2d12715",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "成功了。耶～",
      "source_fingerprint": "00e2c78296cf319c07113f6c32a700afeffd147e8dcb589a73caa36ec828845e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:572c8fc6a525691093c3b888",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今年也一转眼就要结束了。\r\n想做的事情都做完了吗？\r\n小真还有很多事情没做呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7188f7fa9a3575e3018095ddc3056473b77a62396a289478b8f6c202c2ca8aa4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3385b32fbc59b08efbe4a745",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "生日快乐。顺利度过一年\r\n看似容易，实则弥足珍贵。\r\n明年也要让我替你庆生喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c8eb0a6fff98c76ae4e229285d1461cf912664e7b99a365a76e0674879961010",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ed70ced2790f6829cf746510",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "用来庆祝生日的花，我等等会做成\r\n干燥花。无论是明天或后天，\r\n都要继续欣赏它喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b6f2a1055aa8859c4ed90afadd595171ead2855b3214e8465cc526c675c392a0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1911a22d9087447748754552",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小真难得生日，\r\n请帮我大肆庆祝一番。\r\n要让我获得许多幸福喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9c2c13e45d4e60b2bbc0035c704fa096a62caece77796d13a9718b74760b73f1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9935be7866d1987fc3e9bc71",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "顺便问一下，\r\n过了几岁，才能被训练员\r\n当成大人看待呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "100feed1dbee2f4b6bf346057240d88536159119d765b979374b2d5d98a57ec4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d6239efa981af246651dffa3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像收到新公告了。\r\n如果五秒以内没看就会「砰！」……\r\n应该不至于做到这种程度。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2621ac6edb7696f61269076dca3dc2c76faa2c1614cb463ae29863aa6635a3bc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:17d1c389b99b142d74ffced6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀，好像有礼物送到了。\r\n有寄给小真的粉丝信吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a46e58521c18a55a18b0c5fc6c230a4c209cd7c3124fe157fbd9fb150cbd2006",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1d2e36bac0a902cc836e5dfe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀，好像有已经达成的任务。\r\n去领取奖励吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d599ed9a57986a532893af401f29ecb3ea39398bd8c886d2e65ddd4c96a5a53a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1313d643f249f034a3b348df",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀。是新活动的通知……\r\n哔哔！小真调查队集合！\r\n请提供详细的报告！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9364c4cb359011ab4fe30cbb0b4faac4e6dc24efb7e38096e3e7fe69c1d62c4d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6267345efc7168cbebffa83f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊……活动开始了。\r\n只要趁现在查看，\r\n就能掌握下一波流行的灵感……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "059589f6bcacfed8a3139a65e9b70cd87cd6f66b742ec10c288e2e3c5873b889",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:76bfc4fae3911b023cc9c4e4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔……输掉了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b82a05b3e4ac50cdf500abe7a02126d7e2f95d476c1d7adb42772a2b76737d7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:db1446aa1afce36c4927938c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赛马娘名鉴的等级好像提升了。\r\n为了进行市场调查，\r\n须要去确认一下信息。",
      "source_fingerprint": "264c4be0a990faf9681c09ef334b9ea92d953455a2c3fe12169d04340746eb28",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "10021"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
